  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Breaking: now targets .NET 10 (was .NET 7). Fixed IsValidEmail throwing RegexParseException on every call due to invalid character-class syntax in the email pattern. Fixed a bug where two conflicting EntityValidator implementations existed side by side; consolidated into a single implementation that collects every validation error instead of stopping at the first one. Fixed the UK phone number regex rejecting real numbers. Added IsValidPostalCode, IsValidUrl, IsValidCreditCardNumber, IsValidPassword, IsValidIPAddress, IsInRange, and IsValidLength, each with a matching validation attribute. Enabled nullable reference types throughout and resolved all compiler warnings.",
